documentation/design/neural-learning/fly-connections-memory-v1-gates-2026-11-08.md:47:3. Pressure was real: `summarizePressure` passes (B writes change at least 25% of A-written edges by at least 1% of naive magnitude, and at least 25% of the mask changes by at least 1% by T_AB). If this fails, P2 is untested, which counts as not passed.
